{
  "info": {
    "name": "BookLeaf Author Support API",
    "description": "REST API for the BookLeaf Author Support & Communication Portal.\n\n**Authentication.** `POST /auth/login` sets an httpOnly `bl_token` cookie (used by the web app) and also returns the JWT in the body, so tools can send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Every endpoint except health, login and logout requires one of the two.\n\n**Roles.** Author endpoints only ever return the caller's own data. Another author's ticket or book is a `404`, indistinguishable from one that does not exist. `/admin/*` and `/users` are admin-only (`403` for authors).\n\n**Errors** always use the shape `{ success: false, error: { code, message, details[], requestId } }`. Validation failures list `details[].field`: `422` for a bad body, `400` for bad URL params or query. Some errors add machine-readable fields, such as `fallback` on `AI_UNAVAILABLE`.\n\n**Demo accounts.** `admin@bookleaf.com` / `Admin@123`; any seeded author (e.g. `ananya.reddy@email.com`) / `Author@123`.\n\nRun \"Login as admin\" or \"Login as author\" first: they store {{token}} for every other request.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "ticketId",
      "value": "BL-0005"
    },
    {
      "key": "bookId",
      "value": "BK005"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Start here",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@bookleaf.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Sign in with email and password\n\nSets the httpOnly `bl_token` cookie and returns the user and token. Rate-limited to 10 failed attempts per 15 minutes per IP.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.success) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", body.data.token); }",
                  "pm.test(\"signed in\", () => pm.expect(body.success).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as author (Ananya)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ananya.reddy@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Author@123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Sign in with email and password\n\nSets the httpOnly `bl_token` cookie and returns the user and token. Rate-limited to 10 failed attempts per 15 minutes per IP.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.success) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", body.data.token); }",
                  "pm.test(\"signed in\", () => pm.expect(body.success).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
