              ]
            },
            "description": "Get an AI draft reply (cached)\n\nBuilt from the knowledge-base sections for the ticket's category, the referenced book's real data and the last 3 messages. Cached per ticket until the context changes (new message, new day, prompt/KB version); `regenerate=true` forces a new one. If the AI is unavailable, returns `503 AI_UNAVAILABLE` with a category template and the last good draft."
          }
        },
